window.products.push({"id":404013,"name":"Ursetup Electric Standing Desk Frame with Memory Controller, Height Adjustable Rising Table Legs, Sit Stand up Desk Frame with Sturdy Dual Beam, Ergon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5blBAWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Built For Work From Home】: This perfect standing desk frame to make independent and remote workers to stay healthy, active, and productive while working from home. Easy and convenient to adjust the comfortable height and switch sit-stand posture, standing desk legs is suitable for people who need to sit for a long time to work or study. It can help us reduce the burden on our neck and waist and relieve the fatigue of sitting for a long time. 【Electric Lift System】: Powerful motor lift system for adjusting desk height smoothly, quickly and evenly at a speed of 1\"/second with low noise. The quiet and fast movement improves focus and efficiency. The sturdy desk frame equipped electric lift system to offer height adjustment from 29’’ to 48’’ and width from 43\" to 63\", providing two different ways of working, traditional sitting office and the standing office. Reliable long-term operation. (Tested 50,000 times and still going strong). 【Outstanding Stability】: This electric standing desk frame has a sturdy solid steel frame with aerospace-grade lifting column connectors, still stable & secure after testing 50,000 times. Heavy-duty powder coating steel frame is stable and solid enough to allow 230lbs/105kg load capacity. It's a firm foundation for work, even at full height. strong support for your ideal working space. The horizontal legs are fitted with non-slip pads to accommodate any floor surface. 【3-Level Height Memory Function】: Sit stand desk frame with memory controller, the easy-to-use push button controller features 3 memory presets so you can easily find and save your ideal desk height. LCD display clearly shows you the exact height of the standing desk legs. 【Desktop Compatibility】: Desk frame height: 29 inches to 48 inches. Support desktop size: length of 43.3\" to 70.8\", width of 22\" to 35\". Technical Support: You will get 2 year support to help with any questions or concerns, Include all accessories and operating instructions for product installation. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n5blBAWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ursetup","source_asin":"B0BTLV92DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTLV92DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTLV92DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
