window.products.push({"id":404060,"name":"Sumnacon 2 Pcs Metal Curtain Holdbacks - Decorative Wall Mounted Drapery Tiebacks with Screws, Heavy Duty Window Treatment Holdbacks for Home Decor, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612J0qWDHjL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Description: Amazing Heavy Duty Metal Curtain Holdbacks, excellent to give your room a quick and easy revamp. ✬These metal Curtain Holdbacks are solid and well made, can have a magical effect in decorating your house. ✬These drapery tiebacks are very easy to install, and come with screws. And you can also use them as curtain rod brackets for heavy duty rod. ✬They will match your curtain rods perfect and look fantastic with or without the curtains pulled back. ✬It Makes opening and closing the drapery panels very easy, they also don't wrinkle the drapes as much as the tie backs. And look great when drapes are pulled back, they are hidden when the drapes are closed. Specification: - Material: Metal - Size Information: 15.5 x 9.5cm/6.1 x3.7\"(LxW). - Color: Green Bronze Package included: - 2 X Metal Curtain Holdbacks - 4 x Anchors - 4 x Screws","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612J0qWDHjL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sumnacon","source_asin":"B08DJ1GND8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DJ1GND8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DJ1GND8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404061,"name":"Houseables Ironing Blanket, Magnetic Mat Laundry Pad, 18.25\"x32.5\", Gray, Quilted, Washer Dryer Heat Resistant Pad, Iron Board Alternative Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kc4LslQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTANTLY TRANSFORM ANY FLAT SURFACE INTO AN IRONING BOARD. Our magnetic ironing mat instantly transforms any flat surface into a convenient ironing board. Its padding is made from a high quality quilted polyester-cotton fabric that can withstand high heats between 250°F - 300°F. Each corner of the mat contains a heavy-duty magnet that attaches itself to any metallic body surface for a secure hold while you iron. PORTABLE DESIGN ALLOWS IT TO BE TAKEN ANYWHERE. The mat measures 32 ½” x 19” so it will fit completely atop most standard sized washer or dryers. Its lightweight but flexible design allows the mat to be rolled up, folded flat, or hung up between uses for space-saving storage. It also doubles as a convenient padding protector for your washer or dryer tops, keeping the surface safe from dust, scratching, and other minor surface damage. PERFECT FOR SMALLER SPACES AND TRAVEL. This mat serves as a clever alternative to traditional ironing boards, proving especially valuable to those who reside in studio apartment, dormitories, RVs, or other smaller living spaces that may not be able to facilitate bulky ironing boards. DURABLE ENOUGH TO HANDLE ANY SIZED JOB. Whether all you need is a quick touch up on a garment after it’s been pulled from the dryer, or you are tackling a load of heavier garments, this ironing mat can handle any sized ironing job. Its portability makes it a perfect traveling accessory, anywhere you may roam. ISN'T IT IRONIC: Ironing has never been more convenient, your clothes have never looked neater, and you have never looked sharper. Stop putting off until tomorrow what you can iron today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kc4LslQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houseables","source_asin":"B011W12XO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011W12XO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011W12XO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
