window.products.push({"id":404126,"name":"Megachef 930111879M Multipurpose Halogen Oven Air fryer in White, 13 quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811lSbJx6jS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The multipurpose halogen oven air fryer has the ability to do Many things all from the kitchen counter top. Defrost, broil, Roast, Bake, steam, grill, and BBQ. Perfect for chicken, steak, ribs, fish, shrimp, French fries & chips and more. No need to preheat or defrost frozen meat for the best flavor and taste. High temperatures & Built-in fan circulates the air for moist & savory meals. With the multipurpose halogen oven air fryer eliminates the need for any extra oil. Cooks thoroughly & retains distinct ingredient flavor. With the multipurpose halogen oven air fryer you will never have any loss of nutrition. Simply mix the food ingredients and put them into the air fryer. The easy-to-use rotation control sets the corresponding cooking temperature and time and automatically turns off when finished. Shorter and more efficient cooking time than traditional ovens. The see-through glass bowl is designed to let you see the progress of your food without the need to open the cooking chamber & let the heat escape. The multipurpose halogen oven air fryer can cook meals for a whole family in one serving. With the extender Ring, you will be able to cook multiple food all at once. The accessories make it easier to cook all of your favorite foods without changing pots and pans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811lSbJx6jS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Megachef","source_asin":"B07R5Q2MBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R5Q2MBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R5Q2MBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
