window.products.push({"id":404148,"name":"Sunflower Guess How Many Kisses Game Sign and Cards Great For Bridal Showers and Weddings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S93Lxqp2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why choose Your Main Event’s party items? We know that you have many choices when looking for invitations,  and party decorations, and we appreciate you giving us the chance to be a part of your special event! ★ 5x7 Double Sided Stand up sign and 50 Guess Cards ★ Place sign and cards in front of a jar or bottle filled with candies and have your guests guess how many candies there are. The guest who guesses closest to the total, without going over, is your winner. Candy, jar, and prizes are not included. ★ Designed and printed exclusively by Your Main Event Prints, a small family owned business in the USA. ★ 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - We are here to help! If you aren't happy with your purchase, please do not hesitate to get in contact with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S93Lxqp2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Your Main Event Prints","source_asin":"B0849JPTZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0849JPTZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0849JPTZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404149,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, 3 Packs Round Ice Cube Trays for Freezer, Easy-Release Ice Ball Maker Mold with Removable Lid and Bin Making 1in X 111Pcs Ice Balls for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZIN4VA9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Updated Ice Cube Tray】: The Ice Cube Tray comes with 3 packs of round ice ball trays, a bin with lid and an ice scoop. You could make 37 Pcs ice cube balls for each pack of tray at one time, and then pour them into the container for storage. Whenever you want to have ice drinks, just use the scoop to take some ice cubes and enjoy your time. 【The Right Size for Freezing】: The set of circle ball ice trays makes ice balls of 1 inch, which could be the perfect size for using. Wait for the chilling patiently and it would not take you much time. Furthermore, the ice making tray has a unique design with grooves on both sides of the edge, which means you would have enough space for your hand when put the tray out of the ice box. Compared with most of the ice cube tray without grooves, the ice cube tray with lid and bin would have more practical significance. 【Enjoy The Process of Using】: It could be easy to use it and do not get worried about how to use. Choose your favorite beverage into the tray and snap on the lid. As the ice ball tray has holes on the lid, so you do not need to consider if the beverage would spill over for pouring to much. The excess part would be expelled when you snap on the lid. Then put the ice cube tray in freezer for about 4 hours and you would get 37 1 inch sphere ice balls for each tray. Add your ice balls into your drinks and get the thrill of cold drinks. 【Easy to Release】: The sphere ice cube mold is made of high-quality durable plastic, which makes it easy to pop out thoroughly and perfectly ice balls compared to silicone ones. Besides, the chew ice making mold without chemical smell and toxic would be suitable for your children. When you get the tray out of freezer, open the lid and hold the edge, then give a gentle twist to the tray for releasing. All the ice balls would get down into the bin instantly. 【Multiple Uses】: Except for pure water, you could also put fruits, coffee, milk, yogurt, jelly, baby food, vegetable puree and chocolate into the cube tray to make ice balls with any taste you want. Besides, the ice cube tray could also be used at outdoor activities like parties, camping, restaurants or wherever you want to have an ice drink. Add the ice ball into smoothies, whiskey, cappuccino, crushed ice, coffee and others and just have fun. Hope it could be one of your favorite kitchen gadgets and tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZIN4VA9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"foroyalife","source_asin":"B0C5H2ZS6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5H2ZS6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5H2ZS6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
