window.products.push({"id":404166,"name":"QSYFCTTEX Blackout Curtains for Bedroom - Grommet Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Curtains for Living Room Set of 2 Panels (42 x 63 Inch, Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vUT8o98BS._AC_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester The package includes set of 2 blackout curtains; Each panel measures 42 Inch wide by 63 Inch long.Our bedroom Curtains with grommet construction, each curtain panel has 6 elegant silver metal grommets with 1.6-inch inner diameter, fit well with most rods. Easy to hang, and slide smoothly. Blackout Functions: Our bedroom curtains can block out 85%-99% sunlight and UV ray ( Darker colors work better), perfect for late sleepers and afternoon naps. Thermal Insulated: Our energy saving curtains insulate against summer heat and winter chill to balance your room temperature, cut down energy bills. Reduce outside noise, protect floor and upholstery from color shading. HASSLE FREE: Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry low and warm iron as needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vUT8o98BS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QSYFCTTEX","source_asin":"B091T62MHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091T62MHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091T62MHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404167,"name":"Cohasset Colonials New York Candle Stand - Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IZv70g3UL._AC_.jpg","description":"The design of this stand, with its slender urn-shaped pedestal, reeded rectangular top with angled corners, and tapered concave legs is typical of New York City cabinetmakers, working in mahogany, circa 1800 - 1810. The original we measured is a rural example of the same period, in birch wood. Our reproduction is hard maple. Shown in Medium Stain. Our furniture kits include all necessary glue, screws, hardware, sandpaper, and assembly instructions. The price of the kit also includes a sufficient quantity of our Medium Wiping Stain. Over the stain, a final finish is required. Your local hardware store can supply varnish (ask for satin or eggshell). Height is 26 5/8\". Top measures 18\" x 15\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IZv70g3UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cohasset Colonials","source_asin":"B002TI7XDI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002TI7XDI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002TI7XDI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
