window.products.push({"id":404186,"name":"Saffron Marigold Sultans Palace ~ Purple Blue Moroccan Vintage Round Tablecloth 90 Round","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515aHqOCPsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Use our colorful cotton tablecloths to set the mood you want to create, regardless of the occasion. So whether you are looking for colorful picnic table cloths, or something cheery for your country kitchen or even a decorative atmopheric setting for an elegant formal dinner party; this luxury cotton tablecloth is sure to add vibrant color and drama to the banquet.The table cloth is 90 inches round. Each tablecloth is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely finished with neat double stitched hems.Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. Inspiration for Sultans Palace: Fly away on a magic carpet to a distant land and seep in the opulent pleasures of a Sultans Palace. The color palette of this Moroccan inspired print attempts to capture the sights and smells of a Sultans Palace: rooms cocooned in lush lapis hued velvets, smooth ivory marble floors, deliciously cool turquoise water fountains, ornate ocher hued brass lanterns all seductively wrapped up in the fuchsia scented haze of rose attar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515aHqOCPsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B004PMZB62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PMZB62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PMZB62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
