window.products.push({"id":404198,"name":"ZNSAYOTX 4-Piece Sofa Slipcovers High Stretch Spandex Slip Cover Living Room Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch Jacquard Small Checks Furniture Protecto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vNOGBD-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 PIECE DESIGN: ZNSAYOTX sofa covers for 3 cushion couch are specially designed for couches with separate cushions, including 1 piece of base sofa slipcover and three pieces of seat cushion covers. Due to the individual design and the strong elastic edge at the bottom, our couch covers fit better and decorate your couch without changing the overall shape of the sofa, so you don't have to worry about the constant tucking or moving of the furniture cover during your daily activities SUPER STRETCH: Our magic sofa slip covers are crafted precisely by 85% Microfiber Polyester and 15% Spandex material, which is new upgraded, more stretchy, soft, skin-friendly and wrinkle free. Adopted the small checked stylish design, using our stretchable elastic sofa cover will easily refresh your sofa and living room. Besides, due to the feature of high stretch fabric, these universal sofa protector cover can fit most t-cushion, box cushion and high back couches ALL-AROUND PROTECTION: ZNSAYOTX comfortable fitted couch protector covers provide a complete protection for sofa. Rely on the full coverage design and the thick non-slip elastic bands sewn at the bottom, our durable furniture protector can be reliable to stay in place firmly, which prevent sofa from dogs cats scratches, footprints, daily stains and wear for long term use. Great choice for leather and cloth sofas and those families with kids and pets MEASURE SIZE: Our anti-slip couch slipcovers are available in sizes that fit most sofas, chair cover is suitable for length between 31\"-46\", Loveseat cover is suitable for length between 55\"-69\", Sofa cover is suitable for length between 71\"-91\", Oversized couch cover is suitable for length between 91\"-110\". Please refer to the Measuring Guide in the photo to measure the size of your sofa EASY CARE & INSTALL: Our premium slipcovers for sofas are machine washable, please wash at 30 degrees celsius or below. Use mild detergent, gentle cycle, tumble dry low to maintain the color. Please do not bleach, do not iron. For the installation, please read the Installaion Guide and follow the steps to install the protective furniture slipcover set, it's easy and can be done in few minutes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vNOGBD-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZNSAYOTX","source_asin":"B08BJZQ3P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BJZQ3P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BJZQ3P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404199,"name":"yuangao Digital Kitchen Timer, 1 Pack Cooking Timers, Large LCD Display, Loud Alarm, Magnetic Backing, Easy to Operate for Cooking, Baking, Sports, Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TX16fizVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What can yuangao kitchen timer do for you? Yuangao kitchen timer made of high quality ABS material with mini cute shape,multifunction and multiple placement ,can count up and down so can be used as a stopwatch as well as a countdown timer, ideal for cooking food, homework, gym workout, sports, games, time out (for kids), office and classroom timer activities. Three ways for placement, you can put it on the table or stick it to fridge by backing magnet, or hang it by it’s hanging hole. Product parameter 1.Material: ABS 2. Quantiy:1 pack 3. Size:3.14’’X2.95’’ 4. Color: black,  5. Weight:65g(1 pcs) Product function 1.99 minutes 99 seconds counting up /down digital timer 2.Battery switch for power on/off 3.Setting memory for previous timing. 4.Big digits in large LCD screen with loud alarm 5.Flexible placements with magnet, hook and stand back 6. How to use it? 1.Put in an AAA battery(included) and turn the timer on 2.Press the “M” or “S” button to set the required time, then press “ST/SP” button to start timing. 3.The alarm will last for 64 seconds until you press “ST/SP” button to stop the buzzing 4.Press “M” and “S” button simultaneously , it will clear the memory and turn back to 00:00. 5.When it shows 00:00,press the “ST/SP”button directly ,it will just count up until you stop it. WARM TIP: please tear off the plastic film of the battery before you use it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TX16fizVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yuangao","source_asin":"B07C21DFTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C21DFTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C21DFTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
