window.products.push({"id":404241,"name":"Gaming Room Carpet Rugs for Kids Teen Boys Bedroom, Gamer Room Decor Area Rug Carpet for Men Teenage, Non Slip Gamepad Gaming Chair Rug Mat for Playro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dA4xAb1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fashion and Cool Design: This Game Controller Gamepad rug is inspired by gaming, cool graphics making your room fashion and fun. Our gaming area rugs adopt modern 3D printing technology, which has clear pattern, bright color and no fading. Whether the home style is modern or simple, our gamer rugs can fit perfectly, making your indoor style cooler. Our gamer mats are also perfect gifts for kids, teens, men, boys, girls, children, grandchildren, friends or relatives. Safe and Quality Material: Our gaming area rug is made of crystal velvet premium quality polyester. It is soft, velvety, fade-resistant and skin-friendly. With a high density memory sponge intermediate interlayer and thousands of tiny durable PVC dots at the bottom of the mat, our gaming carpet is water-absorbing and anti-slip. You can safely place the area rugs on a variety of surfaces, including hardwood, laminate, carpet, etc. Size and Application: Currently we have 2 sizes rugs available: 59\"x39\"(150*100CM) and 31.5\"x63\" (80*160CM). The vibrant color and stylish pattern design lend a fashionable decor element to your home, bring charming and fantastic feeling for your family. This big gaming carpet rug is a perfect gift for your beloved ones and it is perfectly suitable for home, office, game room, children's room, sleeping room, dorm room, dining room, bedroom, outdoor and etc. Easy Maintain: Our bedroom gaming rugs are very easy to clean. Just add some mild detergent and gently wash carpet by hands or machine. Then put the rug in the ventilation to dry. Please do not expose it in the sun. Vacuum regularly and avoid constant sunlight. Kindly Note: Packing and shipping of your rug may cause temporary creases; these surface waves are not imperfections or damages and will gradually recede; back-rolling or reverse rolling is the fastest and easiest way to remove creases in your area rug. Or you could use the iron to remove the wrinkle and make rug perfect. If you have any question with this item, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dA4xAb1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Textattr20","source_asin":"B0BBKQK95Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBKQK95Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBKQK95Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
