window.products.push({"id":404266,"name":"Silicone Stretch Lids, Set Of 12 Reusable Lids for Bowl - XL Container Lids Replacement Fit Different Sizes & Shapes of Fresh Food Storage (Clear+Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PSAX6lYxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose us? Extra thick silicone bowl lids are durable and will not tear or warp. From the smallest cup up to the largest pots, Unwasted Silicone Stretch Lids are designed to stretch easily to fit any type or size of container to create an airtight seal for cooking, microwaving and storing food. Silicone Stretch Lids hold up well for meal prepping as well as long-term storage in the freezer. They stretch well, making them great for oblong containers. They work especially well for larger containers. The smallest lid easily fits canned goods, making them a good option for storing opened tins of dog food. Cleaning and storing the lids is a breeze. Lids are made from dishwasher proof silicone. Each set includes 12 pack lids to fit any container in a snap: 8.1 inch diameter: stretches to 11 inch diameter.  6.3 inch diameter: stretches to 9 inch diameter.  5.5 inch diameter: stretches to 8 inch diameter.  4.3 inch diameter: stretches to 6 inch diameter.  3.6 inch diameter: stretches to 5 inch diameter.  2.6 inch diameter: stretches to 4 inch diameter.  Save time, money and the planet. Add to cart NOW! How to Use: 1. Place half of the lids over one edge of the container.Start on the side close to your body.  2. Stretch the other half of the lid away from you,inching your way around the bowl.  3. Stretch,then press the top of the lid while pulling the tabs to create a vacuum seal.  4. Pull the sides to ensure a perfect fit. Notice: 1. Keep Dry They work best when completely dry, otherwise they will not stay in place.  2. Thermal Expansion and Contraction When you use the Microwave, please not completely seal container, because the expanding heat and pressure from container, may result in damage or injury.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PSAX6lYxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOSERI","source_asin":"B08CZBWPDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZBWPDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZBWPDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
