window.products.push({"id":404383,"name":"Toothbrush Holder, Toothbrush Rack with Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser Magnetic Cup, No Drill Wall Mount Large Capacity Storage for Bathroom – Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616d9tHjyNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-functional Toothbrush Holder: includes automatic toothpaste dispenser, 2 magnetic cups and 4 dust-proof toothbrush holders. Multi-functional drawer type storage box and top storage for holding your facial cleanser and cosmetics, comb, shaver and more. Wall Mounted Toothbrush Rack: No drill, no tools, will not damage the wall surface. Comes with adhesive for easy installation, save shower space. Easily install on tiles, glass, mirror and other smooth surface. Magnetic Cups: Upgraded magnet design, can make the bottom of the cup and the shelf connected together. The upside-down cup design is better for dustproof and quick water drainage. Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser: The dispenser squeezes the most appropriate amount every time to prevent wasting toothpaste and automatically dispense toothpaste for you. Both suitable for kids and adults use. Tips: Only stick on smooth surface, please wipe the wall before installation. After installation please leave it for 24 hours for better stickiness. AFTER-SALES SERVICE: IF THERE IS ANY QUESTION OR PROBLEM, PLEASE FEEL FREE TO CONTACT US FOR SOLUTION, REPLACING OR REFUND.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616d9tHjyNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samhe","source_asin":"B08JYFKNHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYFKNHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYFKNHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404384,"name":"Seiko Bedside Alarm Clock Silver-Tone Metallic Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pcjxAKATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattoris Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of worlds first technologies transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch  changed the history of time. The first Kinetic  marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches And Seiko technology firmly established todays standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first  Kinetic Technology  powered by body movement. Kinetic  a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy the driving force behind more worlds firsts. Kinetic Chronograph  the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay  automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive  move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation  A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pcjxAKATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B000MBUFV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000MBUFV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000MBUFV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
