window.products.push({"id":404493,"name":"Pasta Maker Machine, 150 Roller Pasta Maker, 7 Adjustable Thickness Settings, 2-in-1 Noodles Maker with Rollers and Cutter, Perfect for Spaghetti,Fett","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2bBl4a-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍲【FOODS GRADE MATERIAL & CLEANING METHOD】 Tired of those pasta machines that smell of metal or plastic? Sailnovo pasta machine is made of food-grade material, The blade attachment of this pasta machine shouldn’t be washed in water or put in the dishwasher. Residual moisture will affect the sharpness of the blade and shorten machine's lifespan. We suggest using a brush or wooden stick, or if you don't have one you can use a toothpick to remove any residual dough. 🍜【7 ADJUSTABLE THICKNESS SETTINGS】Pasta Maker customized adjustment knob with 7 thickness dough roller settings allows you to choose the thickness at will, the thickest can reach 3 mm; through this simple adjustment to change the texture and taste of the pasta. You can also get dumpling skins as thin as 0.5mm by continuously pressing the thickness of the dough, making it easy to show your family and friends how good you are at cooking! 🍝【DIFFERENT WIDTH SETTINGS SUIT VARIOUS PASTA】Choose different pasta with your mood at this moment! A specific cutting machine makes the pasta slices can be cut into two widths-2.0 or 4.5 mm; very suitable for making spaghetti, lasagna, etc. A pasta maker machine can satisfy all your pasta-making needs. ✌【PERFECT GIFT FOR FRIENDS】Manual Pasta Maker is very suitable as a gift for friends. Making fresh pasta is a very rewarding activity. Both the elderly and children can easily use it. It is purely manual, clean & hygienic. The Sailnovo pasta machine is definitely an essential kitchen tool or a perfect gift for your friend who likes to eat pasta. 🎁【CUSTOMER SERVICE & QUALITY GUARANTEEE】Sailnovo Pasta maker is supplied with an English manual. We recommend you read the instructions before making the pasta, if you have any questions please contact us, we will be happy to answer your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2bBl4a-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sailnovo","source_asin":"B0C4DX1RL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4DX1RL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4DX1RL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
