window.products.push({"id":404570,"name":"Asrug Super Soft Fluffy Shaggy Faux Fur Rug No Shedding Faux Sheepskin Chair Cover Seat Pad Sofa Pad Couch Pad Fuzzy Plush Area Rug for Living Room Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813WPIPx1rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EXTREMELY FLUFFY】: Crafted with unique fluffy technology, our faux sheepskin fur rug enjoyed no shedding and super soft advantages. 3 inch high pile plush of this shaggy rug is perfect to your tired feet and body. 【GENERAL SIZE】: It measures 2x3 feet. The size of our rug we carefully selected is general for almost chair cover seat pad, sofa pad, couch pad, living room area rug, bedroom runner, etc.. 【MATERIAL】: Machine-made with premium quality, the suede backing and soft artificial animal wool pile offers wear resistance and non slip, which makes this rug serviceable for long years to come on a wide range of floors as a luxurious, modern and trendy update. 【VARIOUS COLOR OPTION】: Asrug features a simple yet colorful fusion of traditional solid design and contemporary fluffy construction for a neat look that elegantly accents most furnishing and floors with easy-to-design styling. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】: Gentle hand wash or spot clean is recommended. Washed by machine with it packed into the laundry bag, hang to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813WPIPx1rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asrug","source_asin":"B08FJ5SQQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FJ5SQQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FJ5SQQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404571,"name":"Whirley Pop Real Theater Popcorn with 6-Quart Stovetop Popcorn Popper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DVPNB5R6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Face it, sometimes the best thing about going out to a movie is the popcorn, those big plump kernels that always seem so much better than what you pop at home. But this simple stovetop popper changes all that. It really does make awesome, fresh-popped corn that might make you start renting videos instead. The sturdy aluminum pan has a clip-on lid with a stay-cool wooden handle. A turn crank on the handle spins the key element: the stainless steel stirring system that keeps the corn moving across the bottom of the pan, for even heat and oil distribution, ensuring the best popping results. The lid has steam vents, to help keep the popcorn dry and crisp. The enclosed booklet is a wonderful resource, with not only clear and detailed instructions, but also dozens of recipes and popcorn history and lore. These are folks who really do know their popcorn, and the results are outstanding Amazon.com The most significant difference between popping corn in an average saucepot and in the Whirley-Pop is that the latter's aluminum construction heats the corn to a high temperature faster and uses less oil. Instead of shaking the pot across a burner to facilitate popping, just turn the wooden hand crank attached to the aluminum lid. The crank rotates a stirring mechanism that moves the kernels along the pot bottom, distributing unpopped kernels evenly and preventing popped corn from burning. The lid clamps securely to the base, though one end remains open as a steam/pour vent. Wear oven mitts when popping: while the vent prevents popped corn from escaping, hot oil may spit through. When the crank gets difficult to turn, popping is complete. The folks at Wabash Valley Farms, makers of this popcorn popper, are Midwestern popcorn growers, and it's clear they know and love their corn. The information booklet they include with the popper provides not only interesting popcorn recipes but also a comprehensive history of the ancient art of popping corn. The popper also comes with four packets of movie-style popcorn. --Carol Gnojewski","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DVPNB5R6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wabash Valley Farms","source_asin":"B00004Z4GR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004Z4GR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004Z4GR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
