window.products.push({"id":404656,"name":"17oz /500ML Automatic Soap Dispenser-Touchless Infrared Sensor Battery Operated Electric Automatic Soap Dispenser with Adjustable Soap Dispensing Volu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v-VJsleFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description: Our Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser, enjoy technology life. 【Electronic sensors】No risk of bacteria that may appear on the surface of the dispenser. 【Economical and durable】Can be mixed with any hand sanitizer, 1: 2 ratio greatly saves hand sanitizer. 【Touchless Dispenser More Hygienic】You don’t have to touch the pump to use soap. 【2 speed adjustment】 Long press for 3 seconds to press it to turn on/off, tap 1 time to switch the mode. Advantages: 1. Create foam directly, more convenient and easy to wash hands. Just obtain soap by gently extending your hands. Especially when you wash dishes in the kitchen, wet hands don’t need to touch soap anymore. 2. Low power consumption and power saving, just insert 4pcs new AA batteries(not included) into the dispenser, can last long for 4 months+. 3. Made of durable ABS material, environmental and safe for long term use. The fully automatic touch-free operation, to avoid the second cross-infection. 4. Automatic soap dispenser offers a 500ml capacity with visible volume, check volume at a glance. DO & DO NOT: DO dilute the hand sanitizer with water in a ratio of 1:3 or 1:4, otherwise it won't FOAM! DO remove batteries to avoid moisture and liquid leakage if not use it for a long time. Do make sure there's no anything blocking the foam outlet, otherwise the foam can't be dispensed Do better to regularly rinse the pump pipe for 10-20s to avoid the pipe blockage caused by the hand sanitizer drying DO NOT block the foam outlet with your hand. DO NOT immerse the automatic soap dispenser in water or rinse it, otherwise it will short circuit. DO NOT directly use non-foam hand sanitizer or it doesn't work. DO NOT invert the soap dispenser. 4*AA batteries are required, but they are not included in the package!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v-VJsleFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanp","source_asin":"B087JRFKRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JRFKRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JRFKRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
