window.products.push({"id":404695,"name":"10 oz Lead-Free Old Fashioned Whiskey Glasses Heavy Base Tumblers For Scotch, Vodka, Liquors, Bourbon, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fWOpr9BdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AN ELEGANT, OLD-FASHIONED TUMBLER: Heavy base, straight lines, octagonal shape, clear glass – what more could you want from a whiskey glass? This elegant tumbler with the old-fashioned design is a must-have piece for your tumbler collection and it will elevate your drinking experience! THE PERFECT GLASS FOR YOUR DRINK: What is your favorite alcoholic drink? The heavy base tumbler is the perfect glass for whiskey, vodka, scotch, bourbon, and basically every type of spirit! You can also use the BIGA old-fashioned rocks glass for nonalcoholic drinks. It’s up to you! GET THE COMPLETE SET: Why have one whiskey glass when you can have six? The BIGA set includes 6 10oz heavy base tumblers with the same elegant design. So invite your friends over and serve their drinks in these elegant tumblers. We guarantee that your guests will be impressed! MADE WITH THE BEST QUALITY GLASS: Here at BIGA we use lead-free glass to make sure that the heavy base glasses durable and totally safe to use. The high quality glass of the tumblers is also very easy to clean, and the tumblers will always be shiny, no matter how often you use them and wash them. THE PERFECT GIFT FOR YOUR FRIENDS: Impress your beloved family and friends with your exquisite taste! Offer them this set of unique whiskey glasses and be sure that they will love it! The heavy base tumblers are the perfect gift for both men and women, so what are you waiting for? The dimensions of the glass may vary","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fWOpr9BdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIGA","source_asin":"B073S2RXGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073S2RXGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073S2RXGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
