window.products.push({"id":404735,"name":"Hinomaru Collection Artisan Workshop Japanese Mini Tetsubin Tea Kettle Cast Iron Teapot with Stainless Steel Infuser 10 fl oz (Mint Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9P5BzbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tetsubin are Japanese cast-iron kettles with a pouring spout, a lid, and a handle crossing over the top, used for boiling and pouring hot water for drinking purposes, such as for making tea. Tetsubin are often elaborately decorated with relief designs on the outside. They range widely in size, and many have unusual shapes, making them popular with collectors. Tetsubin can be found in many colors with various designs and patterns USE AND CARE: This cast iron teapot holds up to 10 fl oz.To use, add loose or bagged tea into the infuser and insert it into the teapot. Slowly pour hot water over the tea and allow it to steep to 3-5 minutes, and enjoy. To clean， use only clean water. Do not leave tea or water in the pot for longer than an hour, and dry thoroughly after each use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z9P5BzbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hinomaru Collection","source_asin":"B08SJ3SDCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJ3SDCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJ3SDCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404736,"name":"Classical Creations Vase with 12 Sunflowers by Van Gogh 12\" Silent Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pYQIKpQTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful wall clock depicting the famous painting Vase with 12 Sunflowers by Vincent van Gogh. It is approximately 12\" in diameter. This would make a great gift or personal item for the van Gogh aficionado or anyone who loves classic artwork. About Our 12\" Wall Clocks Attractive and functional, our 12\" wall clocks feature beautiful photo-quality artwork and reliable USA-made clock motors. The 1/4\" thick wood base is a premium Certified Green Product that is durable and environmentally friendly. The classic look and quiet operation of our clocks make them perfect for just about any room in your home or office. We are sure you will be proud to give them as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come. Our Classic Artwork Most traditional artwork is rectangular, which leads to the question: \"How do you fit a square piece of artwork on a round clock?\" Most \"fine art\" clocks are made by either cropping a circle in the center of the artwork discarding much of the original image, or shrinking the image down and adding plain borders to fill the extra space. We chose to do something different. Our graphic artists start with a high-resolution copy of the original image, and use state-of-the-art software to digitally \"mold\" the rectangular artwork on the face of a circular clock. Each image is meticulously edited, and care is taken to preserve the integrity of the original artwork while minimizing the distortion inherent in this type of image manipulation. We think you will agree that our clocks are more attractive and capture the look of the original artwork better than other similar offerings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pYQIKpQTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B00I6W1NXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I6W1NXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I6W1NXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404737,"name":"Geniospin Queen Comforter Set 8 Piece, Reversible Boho Comforter Sets, Spliced Aztec Pattern, All Season Comfortable, Bed in A Bag with Comforter, She","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BYNeipMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: This down Alternative queen comforter set features a year-round microfiber fabric construction for comfortable use. The hypoallergenic filling in the comforter, being made of light brushed & pre-washed microfiber, provides exceptional warmth and coziness. Reversible Design for All Season: This Boho comforter set is reversible with a sage green spliced Aztec pattern achieving a stylish look for your room. This modern with casual elegance bedding comforter set is a perfect choice for bedroom decor. Also it can keep you warm and brighten your sleeping space in the winter, and fit to use in the summer. What You Can Get: Geniospin sage green bed set includes queen size boho comforter set includes 8 piece(inch): 1 boho comforter 90x90, 1 flat sheet 90x102, 1 fitted sheet 60x80+14, 1 decor pillow 16x16, 2 shams 20x26, 2 pillow cases 20x30. Excellent Craftmanship: This queen comforter is crafted with fine workmanship. Firm quilting, no shifting after washing, soft and breathable. While the use of reactive printing makes the color of Geniospin comforter set bright. Even after multiple washes, it will look as vibrant as the first night you enjoyed it. EASY CARE & SERVICE: Machine wash cold separately, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach or iron. We provide bedding comforter sets free return and exchange service, don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions, please rest assured to buy. Since the comforter is packaged in a vacuum bag, it is highly recommended to expose it to the sun and tap gently for fluffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BYNeipMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geniospin","source_asin":"B09YYB9RZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYB9RZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYB9RZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":404738,"name":"Baxton Studio BBT6183-White-King Bed Platform, King, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31z5bg5KfAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do not settle for any less than the best when it comes to a good nights rest. We may be biased, but we think our Madison Modern Platform Bed is nothing short of spectacular and is one of the best options out there for stylish sleeping. This king-sized platform bed (slats included; box spring not needed) is made with an engineered wood frame and contemporary white faux leather upholstery, which is softened with an underlying layer of foam padding. Further adding to the modern look, mirrored legs flank the bottom. This Malaysian creation is also available in black or white as a queen bed (each sold separately). To clean, wipe with a damp cloth. Assembly is required. Product dimension: 80\"W x 89.5\"D X 38.7\"H, Internal Size : 78\"W x 81.50\"D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31z5bg5KfAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B0BK5T9MN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-404738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK5T9MN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK5T9MN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
